     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Kopiranje kode s spleta v R konzolo vas lahko neprijetno prseneti, saj lahko vsebuje kak škodljiv ukaz.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Kaj in kako najdete tule: <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://csgillespie.wordpress.com/2017/06/07/security-the-dangers-of-copying-and-pasting-r-code/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://csgillespie.wordpress.com/2017/06/07/security-the-dangers-of-copying-and-pasting-r-code/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237067712000&amp;usg=AOvVaw04EVWPbUZQhuz6OU7NCBCt\">https://csgillespie.wordpress.com/2017/06/07/security-the-dangers-of-copying-and-pasting-r-code/</a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">in<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"http://lifepluslinux.blogspot.si/2017/01/look-before-you-paste-from-website-to.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://lifepluslinux.blogspot.si/2017/01/look-before-you-paste-from-website-to.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237067712000&amp;usg=AOvVaw33NK0zkVrxWGHcUEP5reRR\">http://lifepluslinux.blogspot.si/2017/01/look-before-you-paste-from-website-to.html</a>\r\n<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Nasvet: ne kopirajte naravnost v konzolo! Najprej skopirajte v kak urejevalec besedila (v Rstudio v Source editor), da boste videli, če je kje kaj skrito.\r\n<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Svet postaja nevaren, žal tudi skupnosti kot je R community izgubljajo čast.  <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Lepo pozdRav,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Andrej<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"SL\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">--\r\n<br>\r\nAndrej Blejec<br>\r\nNational Institute of Biology<br>\r\nVecna pot 111 POB 141, SI-1000 Ljubljana, SLOVENIA<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"SL\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">e-mail: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n<span style=\"color:blue\">andrej...@nib.si</span></a><br>\r\nURL: <a href=\"http://ablejec.nib.si/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ablejec.nib.si/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237067712000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3TYZq9n8MEq0O7-SVg-WRu\"><span style=\"color:blue\">http://ablejec.nib.si</span></a>\r\n<br>\r\ntel: + 386 (0)59 232 789<br>\r\nfax: <a href=\"tel:+386%201%20241%2029%2080\" value=\"+38612412980\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+ 386 1 241 29 80</a><br>\r\n--------------------------<br>\r\nOrganizer of<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"SL\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">International Association for Statistics Education<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"SL\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">IASE 2017 </span><span lang=\"SL\">Satellite conference<br>\r\n<a href=\"http://bit.ly/IASE2017\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bit.ly/IASE2017&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237067712000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2cagkV6ND60SpsrVEUbE11\"><span style=\"color:blue\">http://bit.ly/IASE2017</span></a></span><span lang=\"SL\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
